01:11:45.602 --> 01:11:48.136
"TO ARMS, TO ARMS"


01:11:48.138 --> 01:11:50.338
"TO ARMS, IN DIXIE"


01:11:50.340 --> 01:11:53.074
"ADVANCE THE FLAG OF DIXIE"


01:11:53.076 --> 01:11:55.443
"HURRAH! HURRAH!"


01:11:55.445 --> 01:11:57.845
"IN DIXIE'S LAND,
